@api = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@transactionId = REPLACE_WITH_TRANSACTION_UUID
@analysisId = REPLACE_WITH_ANALYSIS_UUID

### Liveness
GET {{api}}/health

### Login with a safe local account
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.test",
  "password": "REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_PASSWORD"
}

### Current profile
GET {{api}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Upload receipt
# Most REST client extensions require a real local safe fixture path.
POST {{api}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-upload-0001
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="source"

GALLERY
--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="receipt"; filename="demo-receipt.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./safe-fixtures/demo-receipt.png
--Boundary--

### Run OCR
POST {{api}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}/ocr
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-ocr-0001

### Poll analysis
GET {{api}}/analyses/{{analysisId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### User history
GET {{api}}/transactions?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
